# Keep generated artifacts and bulk asset data out of the GitHub diff and
# language stats so reviews focus on hand-written code. These files are still
# tracked and built normally; linguist-generated only collapses them in PR
# diffs (reviewers can expand) and excludes them from the language bar and the
# diffstat.
#
# External dependencies are not tracked here at all — every one of them is
# fetched at configure time into the build tree. See
# docs/external-dependencies.md for the package targets and FetchContent pins.

# Generated / regenerable parity-harness fixtures (emitted by scripts/parity/).
tests/parity/scenario_facts_generated.json linguist-generated
tests/parity/scenario_table.h             linguist-generated

# Package-manager lockfiles (root + relay/) — generated by npm.
package-lock.json linguist-generated

# Sprite metadata emitted alongside the PNG assets (data, not source code).
pix/*.json linguist-generated
